    "quantities": "Exact original NUMERIC(24,8) compatible decimal strings. Zero, null and unknown remain distinct; no quantity conversion or score is performed.",
    "clocks": "Actual UTC clinical clocks and separate server UTC6 recording; stopped intervals [start,end), ongoing intervals [start,verified_until]. No extrapolation or legacy naive UTC imputation.",
